 "note": "Luna: the owner's own fluffy blue-grey long-haired cat with amber eyes, a white chin and bib, and a moon-blue rune tag on a navy collar. Egg-only, never spawns naturally.",
 "ability_desc": "Moonsight: at night, Night Vision for its owner while within 12 blocks; the effect lingers 15 s (30 s at bond 5). The most animated creature in the pack (83 clips): makes biscuits on beds, wool and carpets; chatters at birds, rabbits and bats and pounces on them; 3 am zoomies; belly traps, pronks and head bonks when petted (and a swat if you overdo it); bleps, loafs, sploots, knocks things off, chases its tail, stares into the void, fails jumps, coughs up the odd hairball (string) and does the cucumber jump when a creeper sneaks up. Every real jump is animated. Not found in the wild: spawn it with its egg (/mm egg get ArcanaLuna); it arrives already named Luna and is tamed with raw cod.",
